# clock shows the time on a clock face, with the hour and the minute hands. The script sets the clock of the machine to 2026-01-01 00:00 UTC first, so the face is the same each time. The menu of button 3 has one item, exit, which stops it.
class exact
window 200x200
run echo 1767225600 > /dev/time; clock
quiet
snap open
mouse 3 at 100,100
exit none
